3.3.3.3           1   FULL/DR         00:00:31    10.1.1.3        GigabitEthernet0/0$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "The local router", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "2.2.2.2", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "C", "text": "3.3.3.3", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "D", "text": "There is no DR", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The neighbor with state FULL/DR is the Designated Router.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$3.0 IP Connectivity$$::text, 25.0, 'fde03105a1a6c7bd', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
