Maximum MAC Addresses      : 1
Total MAC Addresses        : 2
Configured MAC Addresses   : 0
Sticky MAC Addresses       : 1
Last Source Address:Vlan   : 0050.56c0.0008:10
Security Violation Count   : 1$$::text, $$[{"id": "A", "text": "The port has no MAC addresses learned", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "B", "text": "A second MAC address was detected", "is_correct": true}, {"id": "C", "text": "The sticky MAC was removed", "is_correct": false}, {"id": "D", "text": "Port security is disabled", "is_correct": false}]$$::jsonb, $$The maximum is 1 but total MAC addresses is 2, causing a violation.$$::text, $${"https://learningcontent.cisco.com/documents/marketing/exam-topics/200-301-CCNA-v1.1.pdf"}$$::text[], $$4.0 IP Services$$::text, 14.29, '3a2094afe39f49fc', true) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
-- +goose StatementEnd

